(
    title: "Amidar",
    description: Some("A port of Konami\'s arcade maze game. You move around a fixed grid of rectangles, and — alternating by level between a paint-roller and a coin-collecting gorilla — you colour in the lines: trace all four sides of a rectangle to fill it, and fill every rectangle to clear the board. Enemies patrol in the fixed up-and-down \"Amidar\" pattern; the jump button makes them all hop so you can slip underneath, and painting the four corners briefly lets you touch them away."),
